{
    "title": "Catch Tiles: Piano Game",
    "description": "<b>Catch Tiles: Piano Game</b>\r\n\r\nCatch the tiles of this magical piano game and enjoy the rhythm of your favorites songs. Ready to challenge your hand speed limit?\r\n\r\n<b>Catch Tiles: Piano Game</b> is the best piano game for you!\r\nThis music game is <b>FREE</b> with many HOT songs you can play:EDM, classic, anime, KPOP, Eng POP, Vocal... \r\n\r\nPlay popular piano songs or upload loved songs from your phone.\r\nPlay piano online with another and get rewards.\r\n\r\n- How to play:\r\n\r\nSimilar with piano music games, you just have to tap the black tiles then enjoy the fantastic music and rhythm in game. You will lost if you miss a black tile or tap on a white tile. Try to complete magic songs with 3 stars or 3 crowns to get more rewards.\r\n\r\n- Game features:\r\n\r\n. Everybody can play favorite songs: original, classic, anime, KPOP, Eng POP, EDM, Vocal... by simple and update frequently.\r\n. Upload custom songs on your phone.\r\n. Battle online with world-wide players.\r\n. Choose many cute piano tile styles.\r\n. Daily rewards and lucky wheel.\r\n. Save progress by login facebook for another devices.\r\n. Compare scores with friends and top players.\r\n. Easy to play but hard to master.\r\n\r\nGet relax with piano games and play music with your feeling! Tapping only the music tile in some high speed songs can be a real challenge! You will get your pianist dream!\r\n\r\n\r\nSupport:\r\nAny problems? Send feedback to us: wingsmob@outlook.com or in the game by going to Settings > FAQ and Support.\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://wingsmob.net/terms-of-use.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://wingsmob.net/privacy-policy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Catch Tiles: Piano Game</b><br><br>Catch the tiles of this magical piano game and enjoy the rhythm of your favorites songs. Ready to challenge your hand speed limit?<br><br><b>Catch Tiles: Piano Game</b> is the best piano game for you!<br>This music game is <b>FREE</b> with many HOT songs you can play:EDM, classic, anime, KPOP, Eng POP, Vocal... <br><br>Play popular piano songs or upload loved songs from your phone.<br>Play piano online with another and get rewards.<br><br>- How to play:<br><br>Similar with piano music games, you just have to tap the black tiles then enjoy the fantastic music and rhythm in game. You will lost if you miss a black tile or tap on a white tile. Try to complete magic songs with 3 stars or 3 crowns to get more rewards.<br><br>- Game features:<br><br>. Everybody can play favorite songs: original, classic, anime, KPOP, Eng POP, EDM, Vocal... by simple and update frequently.<br>. Upload custom songs on your phone.<br>. Battle online with world-wide players.<br>. Choose many cute piano tile styles.<br>. Daily rewards and lucky wheel.<br>. Save progress by login facebook for another devices.<br>. Compare scores with friends and top players.<br>. Easy to play but hard to master.<br><br>Get relax with piano games and play music with your feeling! Tapping only the music tile in some high speed songs can be a real challenge! You will get your pianist dream!<br><br><br>Support:<br>Any problems? Send feedback to us: wingsmob@outlook.com or in the game by going to Settings &gt; FAQ and Support.<br><br>Terms of use: https://wingsmob.net/terms-of-use.html<br>Privacy Policy: https://wingsmob.net/privacy-policy.html",
